activity logs. Not even Global Administrators are able to clear the logs, so there are always some indications of any rogue activity.\n\nHowever, AFAIK, elevating yourself to User Access Management is not clearly visible in Azure or Azure AD audit logs. Granting Virtual Machine Contributor rights can be found at Activity log of the Azure subcsription.\nAlso, running the scripts is logged to activity log, although the contents of the scripts are not logged."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0005","technique":"T1562.008"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--35652c79-2c41-5d60-81ba-b5e47aa554bf","120":"instance--53906203-fffb-5af3-b112-44a9b4b49b8f","150":"instance--465fbc8a-7b4c-569f-be00-c0fbc137fcfc","180":"instance--a653c96b-3673-5dfa-968e-188fffe4cc04","210":"instance--6a344cf5-bd5c-52db-84f5-23c7701c7a5e","30":"instance--913561d1-b5f3-54d2-8272-159233dfde54","330":"instance--d59fe52d-c897-5f3a-919a-c2273cb8a8b3","60":"instance--f1fd6a3d-bb83-543d-a379-39d4632978f7","90":"instance--4cd6fce2-0d24-57f0-b161-12a867cd1100","branch:False":"instance--f7e897b3-3607-5ea5-8d15-5f83ba8a60da","branch:True":"instance--39b5ac19-b0dd-5674-a7d9-d75e659fe9ea"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-condition--1","properties":[["description","However, you need to get a new Access Token for the changes to take effect:"]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--2ff8b105-17d8-5bc8-9736-a71ca9281068","120":"instance--fe9b11f7-9a07-51c8-93b2-02f34148833b","150":"instance--15f0676c-2f2f-58cf-99a3-b5eade2d286e","180":"instance--cdc5e3d9-a0b4-5995-98a3-d1a29532ffb1","210":"instance--75ed5df8-ff2f-5667-9748-b8587a1ee318","30":"instance--46009917-4258-54e5-9e91-c46c4a45d34d","330":"instance--54845373-a5f0-5af0-b348-5b0a3b4fbe67","60":"instance--f1f8d9a5-1f2a-55c4-af9a-f2629bc0827a","90":"instance--ddfb6e54-4af9-5771-910f-b4c7ba6e9860","branch:False":"instance--64607b7d-a4bd-56e7-9116-7bc21201c8bf","branch:True":"instance--f635d174-aa29-531f-b9c8-0cc481c6c1dd"},"id":"condition","instance":"attack-conditio